            <ArticleTitle>[Physical therapy treatment of pain].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>567-71</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain control is one of the primary goals of physiotherapeutical methods. Unfortunately, the true mode of pain relief by most of the applied physical methods remains hypothetical. Based on a problem orientated proceeding, decisive factors for the prescription of physical methods shall be presented. Emphasis has been placed on the practicability, safety and economical aspects of prescribed methods.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
